| Amendment history | Labor Law: portal marks 106 articles as amended. Of the articles relied on below, Arts. 26, 32, 33, 34 and 36 are unamended; Art. 28 was reworded by Royal Decree M/44 of 8/2/1446H (in force from 20/8/1446H = 19 February 2025 per the portal note); Art. 35 was replaced by Royal Decree M/46 of 5/6/1436H and again by M/44; the penalties chapter (Arts. 229-241) was restructured into Arts. 229-233 by M/46 of 1436H, with Art. 229 bis added and Art. 230(5) amended by M/44. Rows citing amended articles were read from the "تعديلات المادة" (wording in force) blocks in the regenerated source file; the original wording is quoted only where identified as such. Nitaqat: the 2021 guide replaced the fixed size-band system with a continuous formula; leads from the 2026-09-04 amendment watch claim a new 2026-2028 phase from 26 April 2026 with higher sector quotas and, from 15 April 2026, Saudization credit only for Qiwa-documented contracts (unconfirmed). Note the guide predates the 2026 phase: its Annex 1 coefficients are the 2023-2024 values and are presented here as the last primary text available, not as current quotas |
